  "Expert Bartender": "",
  "When an ally deals damage with a Persona skill, Follow Up, HIGHLIGHT, or Theurgy, Yumi gains 1 [Mixer] of the corresponding attribute.\\nAt 3 stacks, they become a <link=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link>. Stacks up to 3 times. Each ally can only give Yumi 1 [Mixer] before the start of next turn.\\nIf 3 Mixers have the same attribute, the Cocktail becomes [Tailor-Made]. If 2 are the same, it becomes [Standard]. If all 3 are different, it becomes [Basic].\\nUsing skills will spend <link=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link> to activate different effects for party and restore $1 SP to party.": "",
  "When an ally deals damage with a Persona skill, Follow Up, HIGHLIGHT, or Theurgy, Yumi gains 1 [Mixer] of the corresponding attribute.\\nAt 3 stacks, they become a <link=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link>. Stacks up to 3 times.\\nIf 3 Mixers have the same attribute, the Cocktail becomes [Tailor-Made]. If 2 are the same, it becomes [Standard]. If all 3 are different, it becomes [Basic].\\nUsing skills will spend <link=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link> to activate different effects for party and restore $1 SP to party.": "",
