  "When mixing <link=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link>, there is a $1 fixed chance to refund 1 random <link=\"s|181\"><u>[Mixer]</u></link>.": "",
  "When mixing a <link=\"s|180\"><u>[Cocktail]</u></link>, randomly gain 1 <link=\"s|181\"><u>[Mixer]</u></link> stack of the attributes spent. \\nWhen activating [Tempting Build] or [Invigorating Blend], spend $2 <link=\"s|184\"><u>[Basic]</u></link> or <link=\"s|183\"><u>[Standard]</u></link> Cocktail first, then gain $3 <link=\"s|183\"><u>[Standard]</u></link> or <link=\"s|182\"><u>[Tailor-Made]</u></link> Cocktail.": "",
