  "L<color=#000000>i</color>festeal": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's Attack by (.+?)% of Yumi's Attack for (\\d+) turns \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> of Attack\\)\\.\\nWhen an ally uses a skill, spend (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Cocktail</u></link> to strengthen that skill's effects\\.\\nHigher quality Cocktails will be used first\\. <link\\=(.+?)><u>Tailor-Made</u></link>, <link\\=(.+?)><u>Standard</u></link>, and <link\\=(.+?)><u>Basic</u></link> Cocktails will increase skill effects by 120%, 100%, and 50% respectively\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) ally actions\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase 1 ally's damage by 1% for every (\\d+) of Yumi's Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> of Attack\\) and their max HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. When the target deals damage to a foe, restore the target's HP by (\\d+)% of damage dealt for (\\d+) turn\\.\\nWhen activating a skill, spend (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Basic</u></link> or <link\\=(.+?)><u>Standard</u></link> <link\\=(.+?)><u>Cocktail</u></link> to gain (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Tailor-Made</u></link> Cocktail\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) ally actions\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Spend all <link\\=(.+?)><u>Cocktails</u></link> to increase the party's attribute damage based on the targeted ally's attribute for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nAttribute damage will increase by 1% for every (\\d+) of Yumi's Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> of Attack\\)\\. Each <link\\=(.+?)><u>Tailor-Made</u></link>, <link\\=(.+?)><u>Standard</u></link>, and <link\\=(.+?)><u>Basic</u></link> Cocktail spent will change this effect by 120%, 100%, and 50% respectively\\.\\nIncrease these effects for the targeted ally by 1.2 times\\. If 2\\+ Standard or better Cocktails are spent, also increase the targeted ally's critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\\nCooldown Time: (\\d+) ally actions\\. \\(This skill requires Cocktails\\.\\)\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's stats by (\\d+)% of Yumi's stats\\.\"": "",
  "Increase party's attribute damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>2%</color> based on main attributes of party members.": "",
  "r:\"At the start of battle, gain <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> <link\\=(.+?)><u>Mixers</u></link>, based on the most common attribute among allies in the battle\\.\"": "",
  "When an ally deals damage with a skill, Resonance, Highlight, or Theurgy, Yumi gains 1 <link\\=\"s|181\"><u>Mixer</u></link> stack of the corresponding attribute.\\nAfter gaining 3 Mixer stacks, change them to a <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>Cocktail</u></link> (max 3).\\nIf the 3 Mixers have the same attribute, create a <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>Tailor-Made</u></link> Cocktail. If 2 are the same, create a <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>Standard</u></link> Cocktail. If all 3 are different, create a <link\\=\"s|184\"><u>Basic</u></link> Cocktail.\\nWhen Yumi uses a skill, spend Cocktail stacks to activate various effects for the party and restore all allies' SP by 8.": "",
  "When gaining a <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>Cocktail</u></link>, randomly gain 1 <link\\=\"s|181\"><u>Mixer</u></link> stack of the attributes spent.\\nWhen activating Tempting Build or Invigorating Blend, spend 1 <link\\=\"s|184\"><u>Basic</u></link> or <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>Standard</u></link> Cocktail to gain 1 Standard or <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>Tailor-Made</u></link> Cocktail.": "",
  "When gaining a <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>Cocktail</u></link>, increase the party's damage by 16% for 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Enchanting Stir and Invigorating Blend by 3.": "",
  "When an ally uses Highlight or Theurgy, increase their Attack by 10% for 1 turn. Also, gain 1 <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>Tailor-Made</u></link> Cocktail.": "",
  "Increase the skill level of Tempting Build by 3.": "",
  "The maximum number of <link\\=\"s|180\"><u>Cocktail</u></link> stacks increases to 4.\\nAt the start of battle, gain 1 <link\\=\"s|182\"><u>Tailor-Made</u></link> Cocktail. After every 3 Cocktails gained, gain 1 more Tailor-Made Cocktail.\\nWhen spending a Tailor-Made, <link\\=\"s|183\"><u>Standard</u></link>, or <link\\=\"s|184\"><u>Basic</u></link> Cocktail to activate a skill, increase the skill effect from 120%/100%/50% up to 135%/120%/75% (includes Tempting Build, Invigorating Blend, and Moonlit Banquet).": "",
  "r:\"^Increase\\\\s+party's\\\\s+Atk\\\\s+by\\\\s+(\\\\d+\\\\.?\\\\d*)%\\\\s+of\\\\s+Yumi's\\\\s+Atk,\\\\s+up\\\\s+to\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+of\\\\s+Atk\\\\s+\\\\((\\\\d+)\\\\s+turns\\\\)\\\\.\\\\nWhen\\\\s+a\\\\s+skill\\\\s+is\\\\s+activated,\\\\s+spend\\\\s+(\\\\d+)\\\\s+Cocktail\\\\s+to\\\\s+strengthen\\\\s+skill's\\\\s+effects\\\\.\\\\s+Spend\\\\s+higher-quality\\\\s+Cocktail\\\\s+first\\\\.\\\\nTailor-Made,\\\\s+Standard,\\\\s+and\\\\s+Basic\\\\s+Cocktail\\\\s+increase\\\\s+skill\\\\s+effect\\\\s+(\\\\d+)%\\\\/(\\\\d+)%\\\\/(\\\\d+)%\\\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase\\s+1\\s+ally\\'s\\s+damage\\s+([\\d\\.]+)%\\s+per\\s+(\\d+)\\s+of\\s+Yumi\\'s\\s+Atk,\\s+up\\s+to\\s+(\\d+)\\s+of\\s+Atk,\\s+and\\s+their\\s+max\\s+HP\\s+([\\d\\.]+)%\\s+\\((\\d+)\\s+turns\\)\\.[\\s\\n\\r]+When\\s+target\\s+deals\\s+dmg\\s+to\\s+foe,\\s+restore\\s+target\\'s\\s+HP\\s+\\(([\\d\\.]+)%\\s+of\\s+dmg\\s+dealt,\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turn\\)\\.\\s+When\\s+activating\\s+skill,\\s+spend\\s+(\\d+)\\s+Basic\\s+or\\s+Standard\\s+Cocktail\\s+to\\s+gain\\s+(\\d+)\\s+Tailor-Made\\s+Cocktail\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Spend all Cocktails to increase party's attribute dmg based on targeted ally's attribute \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\s*Attribute dmg will increase (\\d+)% per (\\d+) of Yumi's Atk \\(up to (\\d+) of Atk\\)\\.\\s*Each Tailor-Made, Standard, or Basic Cocktail spent will change effect (\\d+)%/(\\d+)%/(\\d+)%,\\s*respectively\\.\\s*Increase effects on targeted ally (\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?) times\\.\\s*If (\\d+)\\+ Standard or better Cocktails are spent,\\s*also increase targeted ally's crit dmg (\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?)%\\.\"": ""
